# <%= it.projectName %>

SvelteKit web client<% if (it.hasAuth) { %> with JWT authentication against an external API<% } %>.

Generated with [scafoldercli](https://www.npmjs.com/package/scafoldercli). This
project is yours: nothing depends on the generator at runtime.

## Requirements

- Node.js <%= it.nodeVersion %> or newer
- An API to talk to. Generate a matching one with:
  `npx scafoldercli create my-api --preset nestjs-api`
<% if (it.hasDocker) { -%>
- Docker (optional, for running the client in a container)
<% } -%>

## Getting started

```bash
cp .env.example .env
<%= it.config.packageManager %> install
<%= it.config.packageManager %> run dev
```

The client listens on <http://localhost:<%= it.port %>> and calls the API at
`API_URL` (default <http://localhost:3000>).

